<title>USA: Citizens to complete CB acquisition in Q2.</title>
<headline>Citizens to complete CB acquisition in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>FLINT, Mich. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Banking Corp said it expects to complete its pending $127.2 million acquisition of CB Financial Corp by the end of the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>It signed a definitive agreement on January 27 to acquire the Jackson, Mich.-based institution in a stock-for-stock merger transaction.</p>
<p>The affiliation is subject to regulatory and shareholder approval.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
